worker_module_budget
  module "formal_ai_worker_formalization_request.js"
  ceiling 740
  rationale "Issue #1186 user-facing formalization task, browser twin (issue #1188 JS parity). Mirrors rust/src/solver_handlers/formalization_task.rs and formalization_task_render.rs: cue phrases, the target grammars (FOL, Lean 4, Rocq, Links Notation) and the natural-language recognition tables all come from data/seed/formal-targets.lino; the prose comes from multilingual-responses-formalization.lino. JavaScript-first twin of native handler keys (formalization_request), added under R997-R999 (2026-10-06); growth is the ported handler, not silent regrowth. Ceiling moved 721 to 736 for issue #1186 R5 (2026-10-07): the object-verb (verb_final) main phrase, the deciding-cue language, and the deformalization that reads Lean 4, Rocq and Links Notation through formal_ai_worker_formalization_targets.js with the target leg of the round trip. Ceiling moved 736 to 738 for issue #1186 R4/R6 (2026-10-07): the honesty block carries the rml export step sentence formalRmlCheck returns, mirroring record_rml_fragment. Ceiling moved 738 to 740 for issue #1186 R4 (2026-10-08): formalHonesty takes the clause and fills the localized prover slots from formalProverChecks instead of two hardcoded English sentences."
